# Normalize line endings: LF in the repo, native on checkout.
# This ends the whole-file CRLF/LF churn that used to pollute every diff.
# One-time cleanup (run from Windows git, NOT a sandboxed agent):
#   git add --renormalize . && git commit -m "chore: normalize line endings"
* text=auto
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
